Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test whether the best single model THETA outperforms the current DBA ensemble.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if reducing model set improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a different subset improves over the current best_single THETA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on a smaller, potentially more stable pool (pool1) to see if it can beat the best single THETA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller, potentially more stable pool1 to see if it can beat the best single THETA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean combination on pool2 to see if trimming improves robustness over the current best single THETA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool2","trim_pct":0.2}

